Lava fire-tail frames from SpiralLamp_v2 via tools/lava_harness, 16 ms/frame,
light switch D7 ON, mushroom D11 pressed (after arming). A0=1023 (fader open),
A1=512 (centre speed). SpiralLamp_R4_v0 prints the same rows. SpiralLamp_clean
has no tail.

col: * ball (palette red), O orange, Y yellow, W white, . off.
     Read from the ball outward, the tail is O then Y then W.
     bri is the brightest shown channel as a digit; the white tip is the dim end.
behind: lit LEDs opposite the direction of travel, outside the ball.
ahead: lit LEDs in front of the ball. A one-sided tail stays at 0.
Physics peak is pos/fix. Centre of 160 LEDs is 79.5. The apex row lights LEDs 79 and 80.

